  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Demetler soldan sağa karşılaştırılır: `(3, 9) < (3, 10)`.",
      "en": "Tuples compare left to right: `(3, 9) < (3, 10)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`return tuple(info[:len(minimum)]) >= tuple(minimum)`.",
      "en": "`return tuple(info[:len(minimum)]) >= tuple(minimum)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport sys\n\n\ndef version_ok(info, minimum):\n    return tuple(info[:len(minimum)]) >= tuple(minimum)\n\nprint(version_ok((3, 14, 7), (3, 10)))\nprint(version_ok((3, 9, 1), (3, 10)))\nprint(version_ok(sys.version_info, (3, 8)))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport sys\n\n\ndef version_ok(info, minimum):\n    return tuple(info[:len(minimum)]) >= tuple(minimum)\n\nprint(version_ok((3, 14, 7), (3, 10)))\nprint(version_ok((3, 9, 1), (3, 10)))\nprint(version_ok(sys.version_info, (3, 8)))\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "name": "version_ok",
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": [
